(7144056, 1095418, 30364, '<td valign="top">Tipping towards sentimental, but the several positive qualities rescue it.  Nice clean B&amp;W work.  Lovely exposure.  Very apt that the reflection is the uncertain one in this picture.  Thank you.</td>', 'Tipping towards sentimental, but the several positive qualities rescue it.  Nice clean B&W work.  Lovely exposure.  Very apt that the reflection is the uncertain one in this picture.  Thank you.', '2013-12-18 02:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
