(7144058, 1095522, 28742, '<td valign="top">I... I feel like I just broke up with you in the bathroom. It''s ok, it''s not you, it''s me. :P</td>', 'I... I feel like I just broke up with you in the bathroom. It''s ok, it''s not you, it''s me. :P', '2013-12-18 02:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7144061, 1095540, 30364, '<td valign="top">Can''t say it''s not confronting!  I like that.  Also the implied desperation of the hair and the fist-in-the-sleeve.  Not often that staged shots interest me, but this is a cut above all that and works out very well.  Thank you.</td>', 'Can''t say it''s not confronting!  I like that.  Also the implied desperation of the hair and the fist-in-the-sleeve.  Not often that staged shots interest me, but this is a cut above all that and works out very well.  Thank you.', '2013-12-18 02:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7144062, 1095440, 30364, '<td valign="top">Gives the impression of being seen through the mirror, rather than merely reflected.  Thank you.</td>', 'Gives the impression of being seen through the mirror, rather than merely reflected.  Thank you.', '2013-12-18 02:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7144064, 1095417, 30364, '<td valign="top">Simple but momentarily confounding.  I enjoy looking at this picture because it''s perfectly in tune with itself. Thank you.</td>', 'Simple but momentarily confounding.  I enjoy looking at this picture because it''s perfectly in tune with itself. Thank you.', '2013-12-18 02:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
