(7144155, 1095288, 52549, '<td valign="top">VERY unusual, like it a lot.</td>', 'VERY unusual, like it a lot.', '2013-12-18 06:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7144157, 1095522, 30364, '<td valign="top">Clever title.  Enigmatic model.  Actually it''s a very fine portrait.  Doesn''t seem like a reflection at all.  It feels more like the subject is examining a picture of me rather than the reverse.  Some sort of weird Dorian Gray variation.  I feel so used.  But thank you.</td>', 'Clever title.  Enigmatic model.  Actually it''s a very fine portrait.  Doesn''t seem like a reflection at all.  It feels more like the subject is examining a picture of me rather than the reverse.  Some sort of weird Dorian Gray variation.  I feel so used.  But thank you.', '2013-12-18 06:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7144170, 1095480, 152252, '<td valign="top">A <b>Light Bulb + Wine = Light Bulb Moment</b>. You really cracked me up with this one Paul. Thank you! :) I''m not sure about the <b>Golden Ratio</b> in this one though :P Kidding.<br/><u>GO SHEEP!!! :)</u> (<b><u>commenting only!</u></b>)</td>', 'A Light Bulb + Wine = Light Bulb Moment. You really cracked me up with this one Paul. Thank you! :) I''m not sure about the Golden Ratio in this one though :P Kidding.GO SHEEP!!! :) (commenting only!)', '2013-12-18 07:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7144171, 1095207, 152252, '<td valign="top">Wow. That''s my winner as of right now.</td>', 'Wow. That''s my winner as of right now.', '2013-12-18 07:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7144180, 1095189, 30364, '<td valign="top">What I like most is what I see first ... a dissolute face on the one side, and the suggestion of a nearly featureless mask on the other, at upper right.  Maybe not exactly what you''d intended, but I don''t care about that.  Thank you.</td>', 'What I like most is what I see first ... a dissolute face on the one side, and the suggestion of a nearly featureless mask on the other, at upper right.  Maybe not exactly what you''d intended, but I don''t care about that.  Thank you.', '2013-12-18 08:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7144182, 1095422, 30364, '<td valign="top">Charmingly artless.  Or artlessly charming I suppose.  Odd how the word DOCK gives the picture more possibilities rather than less.  It''s a very interesting study on the idea of interest.  Thank you.</td>', 'Charmingly artless.  Or artlessly charming I suppose.  Odd how the word DOCK gives the picture more possibilities rather than less.  It''s a very interesting study on the idea of interest.  Thank you.', '2013-12-18 08:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7144183, 1095381, 30364, '<td valign="top">Minimally splendid.  Love the title too, which in its unconventionality, is an echo of the photograph.   Thank you.</td>', 'Minimally splendid.  Love the title too, which in its unconventionality, is an echo of the photograph.   Thank you.', '2013-12-18 08:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7144184, 1095427, 30364, '<td valign="top">She''s unexpectedly real.  Must be the lashes.  It somehow achieves more than it should, which is a sign of something good.  Thank you.</td>', 'She''s unexpectedly real.  Must be the lashes.  It somehow achieves more than it should, which is a sign of something good.  Thank you.', '2013-12-18 08:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
