(7144189, 1095409, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well.  It''s a wonderful surprise for us too.  Terrific orientation, and much more thoughtful and sophisticated picture that it might seem at first glance.  What fabulous decor and objects on the dresser.  Perfect casting too.  So many open questions here to tease the viewer.  Thank you.</td>', 'Well.  It''s a wonderful surprise for us too.  Terrific orientation, and much more thoughtful and sophisticated picture that it might seem at first glance.  What fabulous decor and objects on the dresser.  Perfect casting too.  So many open questions here to tease the viewer.  Thank you.', '2013-12-18 08:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7144196, 1095443, 30364, '<td valign="top">Something makes me see this as a cinematographer''s photograph.   It'' s a scene, maybe the ''iconic'' scene, from a Jean-Luc Godard movie.  I like it for its promise of something.  Thank you.</td>', 'Something makes me see this as a cinematographer''s photograph.   It'' s a scene, maybe the ''iconic'' scene, from a Jean-Luc Godard movie.  I like it for its promise of something.  Thank you.', '2013-12-18 08:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
