(7144240, 1094911, 30364, '<td valign="top">If you are who I imagine you to be, then I think that your titles lately are some of the most beautiful one-line poetry I have ever read.  The titles alone are worth 10.  The picture itself is the usual old lo-fi crap, which is everything I love about photographs.<br/> <br/>If you are not who I imagine you to be, then you must be awfully bloody lucky to be mistaken for such an incomparable artist.<br/> <br/>Either way, thank you.</td>', 'If you are who I imagine you to be, then I think that your titles lately are some of the most beautiful one-line poetry I have ever read.  The titles alone are worth 10.  The picture itself is the usual old lo-fi crap, which is everything I love about photographs. If you are not who I imagine you to be, then you must be awfully bloody lucky to be mistaken for such an incomparable artist. Either way, thank you.', '2013-12-18 11:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
