(7144308, 1095461, 49954, '<td valign="top">If you''d cloned out the mirror edges it would have been a stronger image in general, but you had to leave them in as the mirror had to be evident... tough choice... Perhaps softening them would have helped?  Anyway, ignoring those, the mirror effect of the apple is very pleasing...</td>', 'If you''d cloned out the mirror edges it would have been a stronger image in general, but you had to leave them in as the mirror had to be evident... tough choice... Perhaps softening them would have helped?  Anyway, ignoring those, the mirror effect of the apple is very pleasing...', '2013-12-18 14:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
