(7144310, 1095523, 30364, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph. If ever there was a short story masquerading as a picture, this is it.  Could be one of the best, most ambitious photographs ever at DPC because it uses no artifice at all; nothing beyond a clear vision beautifully realised. And nothing else needed. 10, and what else?  Thank you.</td>', 'I love this photograph. If ever there was a short story masquerading as a picture, this is it.  Could be one of the best, most ambitious photographs ever at DPC because it uses no artifice at all; nothing beyond a clear vision beautifully realised. And nothing else needed. 10, and what else?  Thank you.', '2013-12-18 14:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7144311, 1095502, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very interesting picture of a different moment to that actually depicted.  That''s a fascinating idea for a photograph; very adventurous.  I love it for all that.  Thank you.</td>', 'A very interesting picture of a different moment to that actually depicted.  That''s a fascinating idea for a photograph; very adventurous.  I love it for all that.  Thank you.', '2013-12-18 14:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
