(7146927, 1095478, 72103, '<td valign="top">So this is from my apartment in Gurgaon India.  In December we get these early morning mists as the cold air from the Himalayas competes with the heat.   Sometimes, just sometimes, it lies at this low level and up on level 16 we find ourselves above it.  The other building is part of the same complex I live in.</td>', 'So this is from my apartment in Gurgaon India.  In December we get these early morning mists as the cold air from the Himalayas competes with the heat.   Sometimes, just sometimes, it lies at this low level and up on level 16 we find ourselves above it.  The other building is part of the same complex I live in.', '2013-12-25 00:23:58.000000', NULL, 0),
