(7146963, 1095535, 153374, '<td valign="top">This truly was an interesting challenge. In this challenge, I went a totally different way. Dark, if anything. A couple of you thought that it was me that had a problem. Trust me...I don''t. I wanted to try and show something that not only has affected peoples lives but that continues to affect others. I pray for those people to get the help needed to battle this demon. Because even if they think they are alone. I want them to know that there are people out there worrying about them.</td>', 'This truly was an interesting challenge. In this challenge, I went a totally different way. Dark, if anything. A couple of you thought that it was me that had a problem. Trust me...I don''t. I wanted to try and show something that not only has affected peoples lives but that continues to affect others. I pray for those people to get the help needed to battle this demon. Because even if they think they are alone. I want them to know that there are people out there worrying about them.', '2013-12-25 00:54:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7146965, 1095478, 72103, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MNet:</b></div><hr/><i> Your second highest score ever! You came in with the Blue at the right time, High Five Captain! :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Margaret, shows you what a little pressure and competition can make you do....</td>', 'Originally posted by MNet: Your second highest score ever! You came in with the Blue at the right time, High Five Captain! :)   Thanks Margaret, shows you what a little pressure and competition can make you do....', '2013-12-25 01:01:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7146968, 1095491, 554, '<td valign="top">You know, Maria this is a super great photo of a beautiful child. It could be I am so very opposed to harming children I likely let it get the best of me. I actually thought it was a winner, a 10 for sure. You were too close to the subject to see what I was seeing. Anyway, a bit of PS to lighten the area I pointed out and a wall hanger for sure. <br/>I guess SC removed my original comment...thanks to them.  I let it get the better of me.  Sorry, David</td>', 'You know, Maria this is a super great photo of a beautiful child. It could be I am so very opposed to harming children I likely let it get the best of me. I actually thought it was a winner, a 10 for sure. You were too close to the subject to see what I was seeing. Anyway, a bit of PS to lighten the area I pointed out and a wall hanger for sure. I guess SC removed my original comment...thanks to them.  I let it get the better of me.  Sorry, David', '2013-12-25 01:16:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7146970, 1095491, 554, '<td valign="top">I see by reading your comment that you were as passionately upset as I was, probably the reason for the 3 fours and 3 and 2 votes. There has to be a reason as this is an outstanding portrait.</td>', 'I see by reading your comment that you were as passionately upset as I was, probably the reason for the 3 fours and 3 and 2 votes. There has to be a reason as this is an outstanding portrait.', '2013-12-25 01:29:33.000000', NULL, 0),
