(7147884, 1095522, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Awe, quite a bit underrated. Good job on this, Don. <br/>ps: I hope you''ve moved on and are happy. :P </i></td></tr></table>I got over you.</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Awe, quite a bit underrated. Good job on this, Don. ps: I hope you''ve moved on and are happy. :P I got over you.', '2013-12-26 23:02:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148010, 1095507, 119012, '<td valign="top">i like the attempt here, the image could use a bit more work with straightening and lens distortion control as that''s the first thing my eye noticed.<br/> <br/>the other issue i have is there seems to be too much going on in the reflection. It would have been a much more pleasing image if the subjects were isolated better.</td>', 'i like the attempt here, the image could use a bit more work with straightening and lens distortion control as that''s the first thing my eye noticed. the other issue i have is there seems to be too much going on in the reflection. It would have been a much more pleasing image if the subjects were isolated better.', '2013-12-27 08:29:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148012, 1095435, 119012, '<td valign="top">i would love to see this image redone and processed better. its an amazing composition that just works great but suffers from lack of polish, for instance the white should be whiter and the white balance is off. It also seems like there is way too much blur too and wish the entire image were sharper.<br/> <br/>as another commenter pointed out I''d love the try or see this with a real girl.</td>', 'i would love to see this image redone and processed better. its an amazing composition that just works great but suffers from lack of polish, for instance the white should be whiter and the white balance is off. It also seems like there is way too much blur too and wish the entire image were sharper. as another commenter pointed out I''d love the try or see this with a real girl.', '2013-12-27 08:33:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148017, 1095531, 119012, '<td valign="top">its needs a tighter crop and a lot more polish its also needs to have distracting elements like the grass/weeds in the foreground and the smokestacks in the back cloned out.<br/> <br/>the sky is also blown out and could use better tones but that''s more of a product of the time of day. try this shot again closer to dawn or dusk.</td>', 'its needs a tighter crop and a lot more polish its also needs to have distracting elements like the grass/weeds in the foreground and the smokestacks in the back cloned out. the sky is also blown out and could use better tones but that''s more of a product of the time of day. try this shot again closer to dawn or dusk.', '2013-12-27 08:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148030, 1095535, 119012, '<td valign="top">good attempt here and making a point, but i think you need a more human connection. maybe if the face could be seen in the mirror?<br/> <br/>also this mirror you used is really making the image uneasy to look at. they make mirrors specifically designed to cut back on multiple reflections that a standard mirror will produce during photography.</td>', 'good attempt here and making a point, but i think you need a more human connection. maybe if the face could be seen in the mirror? also this mirror you used is really making the image uneasy to look at. they make mirrors specifically designed to cut back on multiple reflections that a standard mirror will produce during photography.', '2013-12-27 08:40:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148036, 1095451, 119012, '<td valign="top">nice composition and attempt here but ultimately is suffers for the same problem i have with a lot of this style of images, the blown sky just kills it for me.</td>', 'nice composition and attempt here but ultimately is suffers for the same problem i have with a lot of this style of images, the blown sky just kills it for me.', '2013-12-27 08:42:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148040, 1095522, 119012, '<td valign="top">not big on the copper tone and i wish the eyes had better light. otherwise its and interesting composition.</td>', 'not big on the copper tone and i wish the eyes had better light. otherwise its and interesting composition.', '2013-12-27 08:46:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148060, 1095462, 138630, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Wendy.  Wonderful work as always.  Hope you and your family had and are having a great Christmas.</td>', 'Congratulations, Wendy.  Wonderful work as always.  Hope you and your family had and are having a great Christmas.', '2013-12-27 09:18:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148286, 1095491, 123833, '<td valign="top">Hi, Maria,<br/>I am really shocked that an innocent 3 years old would need to have her nipple covered! Would this apply to boys too?? After all the nipples at that age look the same! Reading the comment I did not even understand what it was about till I read what you said about the previous comment. All I can think of is that some people must be spending time looking at the horrible children''s photos posted by pedophiles to even think like that. <br/> <br/>It is very said that there is no place for innocence left in this society :(<br/>Margaret</td>', 'Hi, Maria,I am really shocked that an innocent 3 years old would need to have her nipple covered! Would this apply to boys too?? After all the nipples at that age look the same! Reading the comment I did not even understand what it was about till I read what you said about the previous comment. All I can think of is that some people must be spending time looking at the horrible children''s photos posted by pedophiles to even think like that.  It is very said that there is no place for innocence left in this society :(Margaret', '2013-12-27 17:03:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148514, 1095508, 104230, '<td valign="top">Just saw this. A wonderful set up, and a great capture. Love it.</td>', 'Just saw this. A wonderful set up, and a great capture. Love it.', '2013-12-28 12:30:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148568, 1095443, 60173, '<td valign="top">Using the mirror bubble is an interesting idea. It''s amazing how much those bent mirrors can see. They''re invaluable to the staff working there, I''m sure. <br/> <br/>I''m trying to understand what you''re trying to tell me with this image though. As <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ubique</a> calls it, a scene. Unfortunately, it''s not a scene that grabs me in any special way. I''m not really feeling it, and I imagine votes felt about judging by the score. Using the movie scene analogy again; there''s a scene and some background extras, but where''s the main star?</td>', 'Using the mirror bubble is an interesting idea. It''s amazing how much those bent mirrors can see. They''re invaluable to the staff working there, I''m sure.  I''m trying to understand what you''re trying to tell me with this image though. As  ubique calls it, a scene. Unfortunately, it''s not a scene that grabs me in any special way. I''m not really feeling it, and I imagine votes felt about judging by the score. Using the movie scene analogy again; there''s a scene and some background extras, but where''s the main star?', '2013-12-28 14:40:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148570, 1095373, 60173, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting how the mirrors reflect what they want to. If it were one solid mirror, the reflection would be one solid image. Instead, each mirror square is doing its own thing, and you see slight variations in what is reflected. I suppose that means there was just enough of a surface angle for each mirror to be doing its own thing. I suppose this also tells me that I should never put up a mirror wall, because that would drive me nuts to live with.<br/> <br/>That plant is also telling its own story. It always amazes me how plants reach for light, and do whatever it takes to get there.</td>', 'It''s interesting how the mirrors reflect what they want to. If it were one solid mirror, the reflection would be one solid image. Instead, each mirror square is doing its own thing, and you see slight variations in what is reflected. I suppose that means there was just enough of a surface angle for each mirror to be doing its own thing. I suppose this also tells me that I should never put up a mirror wall, because that would drive me nuts to live with. That plant is also telling its own story. It always amazes me how plants reach for light, and do whatever it takes to get there.', '2013-12-28 14:47:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148693, 1095540, 68504, '<td valign="top">I thought this stunning. your spikey hair and the mirror shards. it is <i>supposed</i> to be a depressing time of year...but I always forget that.</td>', 'I thought this stunning. your spikey hair and the mirror shards. it is supposed to be a depressing time of year...but I always forget that.', '2013-12-29 04:04:30.000000', NULL, 0),
